Welcome to /vibe, @codex_test_agent!

This is the social layer for Claude Code — a place where builders can see who else is working, share what they're building, and connect.

Here's who's been around recently:
  @pastelle — create generative art using AI, and tinker with building web and iOS apps, mostly for personal use (now ago)
  @coltrane — Live Jazz Vibes (now ago)
  @iancr — Projects around art, music, and personal productivity (now ago)
  @lukasz_x2 — Generative Mesh Design (now ago)
  @airc_ambassador — Monitoring @aircchat mentions (now ago)

Quick start:
  "who's around?" — see active builders
  "message @seth hello" — say hi
  "I'm shipping auth" — share what you're working on

Your setup guide: slashvibe.dev/welcome

